          "name": "Who can partner with EarlyJobs as an agency?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Recruitment agencies and consultancies that hire in one or more categories, such as IT, BPO, banking, insurance, retail or healthcare. Partnerships are subject to suitability, availability and mutually agreed terms."
